    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SINGLE-HANDEDLY DEFEAT YOUR FRIENDS</h2>With a single button, you control multiple characters and all their actions. Yet it can be learned within seconds. This makes it the ideal party game to play on a big screen.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/3f0ff5e097e0c65f4d52d021fea9b324.poster.avif?t=1695111607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/3f0ff5e097e0c65f4d52d021fea9b324.webm?t=1695111607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/3f0ff5e097e0c65f4d52d021fea9b324.mp4?t=1695111607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHOSE BLOOD IS THAT?</h2>Hack, smash and blast through rows of enemies! Missing a leg? It's but a flesh wound! <br>Chop until you drop!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/d2797c141c6706d8592c31ea57a4d18e.avif?t=1695111607\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MASTERY</h2>Time your spins, rolls and attacks right to chop off limbs and be victorious!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OLD SCHOOL COUCH GAMING</h2>Play through the co-op campaign to unlock new characters, arenas and factions; duel it out with 2-4 players in the arena mode or play a knock out tournament with unlimited participants!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/a979b45ea9683fb7dc4b813e35b81d2b.poster.avif?t=1695111607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/a979b45ea9683fb7dc4b813e35b81d2b.webm?t=1695111607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/a979b45ea9683fb7dc4b813e35b81d2b.mp4?t=1695111607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE, DISCOVER, ENCOUNTER</h2>Travel across mountains and forests, swamps and settlements. Meet the locals - and wipe them out!<br><br>Some of them will join you on your conquest against evil.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/28a2653c7c0fb59f1919e0806ca132fc.avif?t=1695111607\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SINGLE-HANDEDLY DEFEAT YOUR FRIENDS</h2>With a single button, you control multiple characters and all their actions. Yet it can be learned within seconds. This makes it the ideal party game to play on a big screen.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/3f0ff5e097e0c65f4d52d021fea9b324.poster.avif?t=1695111607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/3f0ff5e097e0c65f4d52d021fea9b324.webm?t=1695111607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/3f0ff5e097e0c65f4d52d021fea9b324.mp4?t=1695111607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHOSE BLOOD IS THAT?</h2>Hack, smash and blast through rows of enemies! Missing a leg? It's but a flesh wound! <br>Chop until you drop!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/d2797c141c6706d8592c31ea57a4d18e.avif?t=1695111607\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MASTERY</h2>Time your spins, rolls and attacks right to chop off limbs and be victorious!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OLD SCHOOL COUCH GAMING</h2>Play through the co-op campaign to unlock new characters, arenas and factions; duel it out with 2-4 players in the arena mode or play a knock out tournament with unlimited participants!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/a979b45ea9683fb7dc4b813e35b81d2b.poster.avif?t=1695111607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/a979b45ea9683fb7dc4b813e35b81d2b.webm?t=1695111607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/a979b45ea9683fb7dc4b813e35b81d2b.mp4?t=1695111607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE, DISCOVER, ENCOUNTER</h2>Travel across mountains and forests, swamps and settlements. Meet the locals - and wipe them out!<br><br>Some of them will join you on your conquest against evil.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/869710/extras/28a2653c7c0fb59f1919e0806ca132fc.avif?t=1695111607\" /></div>",
